        "facts": ["The 1992 Convention speaks of common but differentiated responsibilities and respective capabilities.", "Polluter pays ties cost to causation; ability to pay ties it to resources.", "Shue argues no one should give up emissions needed for a decent minimum of life.", "A strong answer tests the chosen principle on a case where the principles disagree."],
