        "facts": ["Duchamp submitted Fountain, a signed urinal, in 1917.", "It was not displayed at the exhibition.", "The readymade challenged the idea that art requires skill, beauty or making.", "A strong answer says what feature, if any, makes the urinal art and an identical one not."],
